Be in the running to win one of 2 x FREE double passes to the Mother Africa [![mother africa competition](/media/2014/05/mother-africa-competition1.jpg)](/media/2014/05/mother-africa-competition1.jpg)Nambour Civic Centre, Sunshine Coast show on July 4th! All you have to do is subscribe to the Rhythm Culture monthly newsletter via our contact form [here](/contact-us/ "FREE tickets to Mother Africa"). Winners of FREE tickets will be announced via our [Facebook Page](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ "Rhythm Culture") and website on Monday June 30th! If you are already a subscriber then grab a friend that you would like to go with and get them to subscribe. Please type 'Mother Africa Competition' into the message box. What have you got to lose!? Happy subscribing!
